{"name": "chenzehaoo/moon_guard", "version": "0.1.0", "summary": "Lightweight supply chain security toolchain for MoonBit packages", "description": "MoonGuard is a pure-MoonBit supply chain security toolchain providing Ed25519 package signing and verification, SHA-256 manifest integrity checks, JSON+PEM trusted key management, Levenshtein and homoglyph typosquat detection, CVSS-style cumulative risk scores, JSON security reports, and a `moon_guard` CLI with subcommands for keygen, sign, verify, trust, typosquat, manifest, hash, audit, and version. Includes a runnable end-to-end audit example at `examples/basic_audit`. MoonGuard \u662f\u7528\u7eaf MoonBit \u5b9e\u73b0\u7684 MoonBit \u5305\u4f9b\u5e94\u94fe\u5b89\u5168\u5de5\u5177\u94fe\uff0c\u63d0\u4f9b Ed25519 \u7b7e\u540d\u3001SHA-256 \u6e05\u5355\u3001JSON+PEM \u53ef\u4fe1\u5bc6\u94a5\u7ba1\u7406\u3001Levenshtein \u4e0e\u540c\u5f62\uff08homoglyph\uff09\u53cc\u6a21\u5f0f typosquat \u68c0\u6d4b\u3001CVSS \u98ce\u683c\u98ce\u9669\u8bc4\u5206\u3001JSON \u5b89\u5168\u62a5\u544a\u4e0e 9 \u5b50\u547d\u4ee4 CLI\u3002", "deps": {}, "readme": "README.md", "repository": "https://github.com/chenzehaoo/MoonGUARD", "license": "Apache-2.0", "keywords": ["security", "supply-chain", "moonbit", "ed25519", "sha256", "typosquat", "supply-chain-security", "manifest", "trust-store", "code-signing", "\u4f9d\u8d56\u6df7\u6dc6", "\u4f9b\u5e94\u94fe\u5b89\u5168", "\u4ee3\u7801\u7b7e\u540d", "\u6e05\u5355\u6821\u9a8c", "Typosquat \u68c0\u6d4b"], "platform": ["native", "wasm", "wasm-gc"], "checksum": "b9dff0bb26c0feb55353103dce4c6a3077d0a51237e0f819975491d4c48ff18d", "created_at": "2026-07-12T15:15:25.734131+00:00"}
{"name": "chenzehaoo/moon_guard", "version": "0.1.1", "summary": "Lightweight supply chain security toolchain for MoonBit packages", "description": "MoonGuard is a pure-MoonBit supply chain security toolchain providing Ed25519 package signing and verification, SHA-256 manifest integrity checks, JSON+PEM trusted key management, Levenshtein and homoglyph typosquat detection, CVSS-style cumulative risk scores, JSON security reports, and a `moon_guard` CLI with subcommands for keygen, sign, verify, trust, typosquat, manifest, hash, audit, and version. Includes a runnable end-to-end audit example at `examples/basic_audit`. MoonGuard \u662f\u7528\u7eaf MoonBit \u5b9e\u73b0\u7684 MoonBit \u5305\u4f9b\u5e94\u94fe\u5b89\u5168\u5de5\u5177\u94fe\uff0c\u63d0\u4f9b Ed25519 \u7b7e\u540d\u3001SHA-256 \u6e05\u5355\u3001JSON+PEM \u53ef\u4fe1\u5bc6\u94a5\u7ba1\u7406\u3001Levenshtein \u4e0e\u540c\u5f62\uff08homoglyph\uff09\u53cc\u6a21\u5f0f typosquat \u68c0\u6d4b\u3001CVSS \u98ce\u683c\u98ce\u9669\u8bc4\u5206\u3001JSON \u5b89\u5168\u62a5\u544a\u4e0e 9 \u5b50\u547d\u4ee4 CLI\u3002", "deps": {}, "readme": "README.md", "repository": "https://github.com/chenzehaoo/MoonGUARD", "license": "Apache-2.0", "keywords": ["security", "supply-chain", "moonbit", "ed25519", "sha256", "typosquat", "supply-chain-security", "manifest", "trust-store", "code-signing", "\u4f9d\u8d56\u6df7\u6dc6", "\u4f9b\u5e94\u94fe\u5b89\u5168", "\u4ee3\u7801\u7b7e\u540d", "\u6e05\u5355\u6821\u9a8c", "Typosquat \u68c0\u6d4b"], "platform": ["native", "wasm", "wasm-gc"], "checksum": "ad126de8d85aca5311371c1f55396109401a15d8e72df15e96539550a559f308", "created_at": "2026-07-12T15:19:38.024620+00:00"}
